WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.650
Phone city overview: 2,000 places grouped into clusters.

00:02.650 --> 00:04.350
Clustering off; zoom in to show pins in the viewport.

00:04.350 --> 00:05.950
Zoom in again: fewer pins are visible.

00:05.950 --> 00:08.870
Pan east, then update labels without replacing marker IDs.

00:08.870 --> 00:10.450
Select Place 0 from the full picker; the map fits it into view.

00:10.450 --> 00:11.600
Zoom out from the selected place.

00:11.600 --> 00:13.220
Return to city view with all 2,000 pins.

00:13.220 --> 00:13.933
Restore clustering; the selected pin stays visible.
